@7017 = ~Sure Strike Club~

@7018 = ~This plain-looking club holds a powerful enchantment. Though simple in appearance, it strikes with the force of a +5 weapon, capable of harming creatures impervious to lesser arms. Its magic is subtle but invaluable to those who understand its true worth.

STATISTICS:

Combat abilities: 
– Weapon is treated as having a +5 enchantment for the purpose of hitting creatures that require magical weapons to hit

Damage: 1d6 (crushing) 
Speed Factor: 4
Proficiency Type: Club 
Type: One-handed 
Requires: 
 5 Strength

