This extraordinary potion reveals the secrets and ancient knowledge of elves.

STATISTICS:

Grants 250,000 permanent experience points per each class of the imbiber.~

@7052 = ~Spirit of the Night

Three major and famous leather armors have been combined into an exquisite artifact.

STATISTICS:

Armor Class: 1
+2 AC vs all weapon types
+45% bonus to hide in shadows
Weight: 5
