@7070 = ~Ring of Vitality~

@7071 = ~Often bestowed upon seasoned adventurers by grateful temples, these golden rings are engraved with runes of endurance. Though not uncommon, each carries a quiet blessing that reinforces the body and fortifies the spirit.
STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
+20 Max HP~

